<div><h1>Welcome, I’m so glad <em>you’re here.</em></h1>
<p class="lead">A door is always open. Trauma, anxiety and depression therapy in Swansboro, with compassionate, holistic care, EMDR, and telehealth across North Carolina.</p>
<div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="https://anewperspectivetherapypllc.clientsecure.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a free 15-minute consultation</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#services">Explore services</a></div></div>
